{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2781680/extras/fd7fa975f72f41f020a2ae15b59b3264.avif?t=1764128737\" width=572 height=74 /></span></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Draw a skin for your Stickman</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Draw a picture that you can place anywhere</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize the colors of all the weapons</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Put on a nice hat</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And More!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2781680/extras/5142aea78ae79aed63281fcadb70533b.poster.avif?t=1764128737\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2781680/extras/5142aea78ae79aed63281fcadb70533b.webm?t=1764128737\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2781680/extras/5142aea78ae79aed63281fcadb70533b.mp4?t=1764128737\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2781680/extras/90a9df76901f3ae2b4a4f7294233a943.avif?t=1764128737\" width=572 height=74 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Utilize a variety of weapons, grenades, and abilities to defeat the Erasers and climb the leaderboards in PvE! Also, try out PvEvP, where you can fight against The Erasers and your StickFriends at the same time! Or race your friends on any level to see who's the king of speed!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/27