o games in the first place.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2781680?t=1764128737","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2781680?t=1764128737","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2781680/ca341e8dde0766eb71e1dc1598f96f03f6bef537/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1764128737","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2781680/ca341e8dde0766eb71e1dc1598f96f03f6bef537/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1764128737","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Steam Workshop","id":30},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Stats","id":15},{"description":"Steam Leaderboards","id":25},{"description":"Includes level editor","id":17},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h1>Feature List</h1><p><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2781680/extras/a0f062cb8fe50ecca686574aea31a591.avif?t=1764128737\" width=600 height=195 /></span></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2781680/extras/fd7fa975f72f41f020a2ae15b59b3264.avif?t=1764128737\" width=572 height=74 /></span></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Draw a skin for your Stickman</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Draw a picture that you can place anywhere</p></li><li><p clas